Misho's yes, 13 Oct 11:2x UTC in the operations chat („ჩემგან ყველაფერზე
კია", relayed verbatim by ops at 11:28Z). 0195b shipped this behind
SERVER_INTRODUCTION_ON=false until his yes on the owner's sentence („{X}-ს
თხოვნა გავუგზავნე, რომ {Y} გაგაცნოს. როგორც კი გიპასუხებს, მაშინვე მოგწერ.").
The switch is now true. Setting it back to false restores the earlier fallback.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
---
 .../__tests__/aTypedIntroductionIsMadeAsOne.test.ts        | 6 +++---
 src/services/introFallback.ts                              | 7 ++++---
 2 files changed, 7 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/services/__tests__/aTypedIntroductionIsMadeAsOne.test.ts b/src/services/__tests__/aTypedIntroductionIsMadeAsOne.test.ts
index 1b448e9..56af78e 100644
--- a/src/services/__tests__/aTypedIntroductionIsMadeAsOne.test.ts
+++ b/src/services/__tests__/aTypedIntroductionIsMadeAsOne.test.ts
@@ -90,8 +90,8 @@ describe('the server makes the introduction', () => {
     mockIntro.mockResolvedValue({ success: true });
   });
 
-  it('ships OFF until Misho’s yes on the owner’s sentence', () => {
-    expect(SERVER_INTRODUCTION_ON).toBe(false);
+  it('is ON since Misho’s yes on the owner’s sentence (CE, §139)', () => {
+    expect(SERVER_INTRODUCTION_ON).toBe(true);
   });
 
   it('sends one introduction request: the named go-between, the target, the goal and the thread', async () => {
@@ -157,7 +157,7 @@ describe('the fallback, wired', () => {
     expect(body).not.toContain('an introduction, not sent as a question');
   });
 
-  it('is off by default, so the fallback is what main does today', () => {
+  it('is behind one switch, so off is what main did before', () => {
     expect(chat).toContain('on: boolean = SERVER_INTRODUCTION_ON,');
     expect(chat).toContain('if (!on || !ownerAsksForIntroduction([ownerLine])) return null;');
   });
diff --git a/src/services/introFallback.ts b/src/services/introFallback.ts
index bbe13b4..ce7492c 100644
--- a/src/services/introFallback.ts
+++ b/src/services/introFallback.ts
@@ -14,10 +14,11 @@ import { IntroRequestContext, requestIntroduction } from './tools/requestIntrodu
  * what was asked. The typed line is the consent (D316), so the server makes
  * the introduction itself, through the same requestIntroduction the tool uses.
  *
- * OFF until Misho says yes to INTRO_SENT_SENTENCES (owner-facing text). While
- * it is off the fallback is exactly what it was before.
+ * ON since Misho's yes (CE), 13 Oct 11:2x UTC in the operations chat: „ჩემგან
+ * ყველაფერზე კია" — to INTRO_SENT_SENTENCES as written below (§139). Back to
+ * false and the fallback is exactly what it was before.
  */
-export const SERVER_INTRODUCTION_ON = false;
+export const SERVER_INTRODUCTION_ON = true;
 
 const SENTENCE_RE = /[^.!?\n]+[.!?]?/gu;
 const MAX_TARGET_WORDS = 3;
